      "message": "Refuse a name the forge keeps, or nobody gets\n\nOne policy, wherever a name is chosen: sign-up, registration, a person\nan owner brings in, a repository made or renamed, a team inside an\norganisation. The forge keeps its own words and the shapes that pass\nfor it; a short list of words nobody gets to be called is refused\nhowever it is spelt, with the usual dodges undone first. Those\nrefusals say only that the name is not available, so the lists are\nnot a game; a page's name says why, since an honest person picking\nagain is helped by knowing. Whoever runs the forge may take the\nforge's own words on purpose, and still not the rest.\n\nTask: t-7445g2bxn7ecqd7cdkhqd099wv\nChange-Id: Inames0129\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
